Third-party data, downloaded at run time and not distributed with this repository,
used under its providers' terms:
- Earth imagery: NASA Earth Observatory (Blue Marble Next Generation, Blue Marble
  clouds, Black Marble 2016).
- Star map: NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center Scientific Visualization Studio, Deep Star
  Maps 2020; Gaia DR2: ESA/Gaia/DPAC.
- Spacecraft models: NASA 3D Resources (QuikSCAT, IBEX).

docs/showcase.gif and docs/m15-detectability.png are rendered from these assets.

Optional tools install their own dependencies: Basilisk (tools/basilisk) and PyTorch
with torchvision ImageNet weights (tools/keypoints).
